[{"id":"MjU4-q01","number":1,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam suatu reaksi redoks ternyata kalium dikromat&nbsp;<img alt=\"(K_2Cr_2O_7)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28K_2Cr_2O_7%29\" /> bereaksi dengan timah diklorida <img alt=\"(SnCI_2)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28SnCI_2%29\" /> dalam suasana asam menjadi <img alt=\"CrCl_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CrCl_3\" />, dan kalium klorida (KCI). Setelah reaksi disetarakan, maka koefisien reaksi dari kalium dikromat dan timah diklorida adalah</p><p>A&nbsp; 3 dan 1</p><p>B. 1 dan 3</p><p>C. 2 dan 3</p><p>D. 3 dan 2</p><p>E. 1 dan&nbsp;1</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDQ"},{"id":"MjU4-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada suhu kamar dan tekanan atmosfer, 1 gram oksigen mengisi ruang 0,764 liter, sedang gram oksida nitrogen dalam kondisi yang sama mengisi ruang 0,266 liter, Berdasarkan hal tersenut ,maka rumus oksida nitrogen termaksud adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"(Ar \\: N=14, \\: \\: Ar\\: O=16)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28Ar%20%5C%3A%20N%3D14%2C%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20Ar%5C%3A%20O%3D16%29\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NO_5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NO_5\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2O_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2O_5\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2O_5\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDU"},{"id":"MjU4-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila 1 liter etil alkohol pada temperatur <img alt=\"20^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?20%5EoC\" />&nbsp;mengandung <img alt=\"1,04\\: X\\: 10^{25}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%2C04%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B25%7D\" />&nbsp;molekul,&nbsp; Maka jumlah molekul selain etil alkohol dalam 1 liter cuplikan etil alkohol yang kemurniannya dinyatakan 99,99% adalah sebanyak..</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"2,72\\: X\\: 10^{20}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%2C72%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B20%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"1,04\\: X\\: 10^{21}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%2C04%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B21%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,15\\: X\\: 10^{22}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C15%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B22%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,13\\: X\\: 10^{23}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C13%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B23%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"2,14\\: X\\: 10^{24}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%2C14%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B24%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDY"},{"id":"MjU4-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Urutan kepolaran ikatan O-H, Ca-O, dan Sr-O ADALAH&nbsp;</p>","choices":["Sr-O&gt;Mg-O&gt;O-H&gt;Ca-O","O-H&gt;Mg-O&gt;Ca-O&gt;Sr-O","O-H&gt;Sr-O&gt;Ca-O&gt;Mg-O","Sr-O&gt;Ca-O&gt;Mg-O&gt;O-H","Mg-O&gt;Ca-O &gt; Sr-O&gt;O-H"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDc"},{"id":"MjU4-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam suatu percobaan reaksi antara&nbsp;<img alt=\"N_2F_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?N_2F_4\" />&nbsp;dengan&nbsp;<img alt=\"S_2O_6F_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?S_2O_6F_2\" />&nbsp;dilakukan pada suhu ruang. Gas yang dihasilkan mempunyai titik didih&nbsp;<img alt=\"-2,5^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?-2%2C5%5EoC\" />, Analisis terhadap gas ini memberikan hasil : 9,48%N&nbsp; 20,9% S, dan 38,0% F. Bila diketahui Ar N = 14,0 : Ar S=32,1 dan Ar F = 19,0 ; Ar 0 = 16,0 Maka rumus empiris gas tersebut adalah.....</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"NSF_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NSF_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NSF_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NSF_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NSO_4F_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NSO_4F_4\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NSO_3F_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NSO_3F_3\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"NSO_2F_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NSO_2F_2\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDg"},{"id":"MjU4-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini yang menakah urutan dari bilangan kuantum suatu elektronik dalam orbital 4d?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015085136.PNG\" style=\"height:178px; width:450px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NDk"},{"id":"MjU4-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini di berikan data entalpi reaksi&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015085952.PNG\" style=\"height:70px; width:497px\" />Nilai entalpi pembentukan bagi CH_2N_2(s) adalah:</p>","choices":["123,79 kkal/mol","14,91 kkal/mol","&nbsp;-14,91 kkal/mol","-29,82 kkal/mol","29,82 kkal/mol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTA"},{"id":"MjU4-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam senyawa atau ion yang mengandung sulfur berikut ini, muatan formal atom S dalam&nbsp;<img alt=\"SO_2,SO_3, SO_{3^{2-}} \\: \\: dan \\: \\: SO_{4^{2-}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?SO_2%2CSO_3%2C%20SO_%7B3%5E%7B2-%7D%7D%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20SO_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D\" />&nbsp;berturut-turut adalah....</p>","choices":["0,0,0,0","-2,0,0,+1","0,+1,-2,0","0,0,+1,-2","+1, 0,0,-2"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTE"},{"id":"MjU4-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan molekul berikut ini:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015092134.PNG\" style=\"height:68px; width:142px\" /></p><p>Manakah molekul tersebut yang mempunyai, moemn dipol tidak sama dengan nol ?</p>","choices":["hanya I&nbsp;","hanya III","hanya I dan II","hanya II dan III","I,II dan III"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTI"},{"id":"MjU4-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini adalah reaksi kesetimbangan :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015100232.PNG\" style=\"height:26px; width:332px\" /></p><p>Bila reaksi sudah mencapai kesetimbangan, berikut ini manakah keadaan yang akan menggeser kesetian kearahan kiri ( Membentuk reaktan lebih banyak ):</p>","choices":["Menurunkan temperatur","Menaikkan tekanan parsial C&nbsp;","Menaikkan tekanan system","Menambah konsentrasi","Menaikkan temperatur</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTM"},{"id":"MjU4-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan 3 reaksi yang berlangsung dalam 3 wadah berikut ini&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015100550.PNG\" style=\"height:133px; width:333px\" /></p><p>Persamaan hukum laju reaksi dalam ketiga wadah tersebut di berikan oleh&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015100645.PNG\" style=\"height:20px; width:126px\" /></p><p>Berdasarkan persamaan reaksi yang diberikan berikut ini manakah pernyataan yang benar ?</p>","choices":["Laju reaksi A = laju reaksi B","&nbsp;Laju reaksi A = laju reaksi C","&nbsp;Laju reaksi B&nbsp;= laju reaksi C","&nbsp;Laju reaksi A = laju reaksi B = laju reaksi C","Laju reaksi A, B dan C tidak dapat ditentukan&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTQ"},{"id":"MjU4-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut adalah reaksi yang berlangsung dalam larutan benzena yang mengandung pirindin 0,1 M:&nbsp;<img alt=\"CH_3OH\\: \\: (A)+(C_6H_5)_3CCI\\: \\: (B)\\rightarrow CH_3OC(C_6H_5)_3\\: \\: (C)+HCI\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CH_3OH%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%28A%29&amp;plus;%28C_6H_5%29_3CCI%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%28B%29%5Crightarrow%20CH_3OC%28C_6H_5%29_3%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%28C%29&amp;plus;HCI\" />ddengan hasil percoaan sebagai berikut :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015101223.PNG\" style=\"height:156px; width:297px\" /></p><p>Hukum laju dan nilai tetapan laju untuk reaksi tersebut berturut adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015101307.PNG\" style=\"height:91px; width:261px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTU"},{"id":"MjU4-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Grafik berikut ini manakah yang menjelaskan hubungan antara&nbsp;<img alt=\"[H_3O]^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BH_3O%5D%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;dan pH dalam larutan ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015101429.PNG\" style=\"height:214px; width:470px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTY"},{"id":"MjU4-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berapa pH larutan yang berbentuk bila sebanyak 0,0600 mol NaOH ditambahkan kedalam 1 L larutan HCI 0,0500 M</p>","choices":["3,45","8,90","12,00","12,78","13,50"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTc"},{"id":"MjU4-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam larutan jenuh nickel karbonat <img alt=\"NiCO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NiCO_3\" />&nbsp;, mengandung 0,090 g dalam 2,0 L larutan berapakah nilai Ksp untuk&nbsp;<img alt=\"NiCO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NiCO_3\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"7,58\\: X\\: 10^{-4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?7%2C58%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-4%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"3,79\\: X\\: 10^{-4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?3%2C79%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-4%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"5,74\\: X\\: 10^{-7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?5%2C74%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"1,44\\: X\\: 10^{-7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?1%2C44%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-7%7D\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"2,87\\: X\\: 10^{-8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%2C87%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-8%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTg"},{"id":"MjU4-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaski redoks berikut ini :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015111216.PNG\" style=\"height:28px; width:159px\" /></p><p>Dalam titrasi, sebanyak 40 mL larutan membutuhkan&nbsp;<img alt=\"4,0 \\: X\\: 10^{-3} \\: mol\\: l_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4%2C0%20%5C%3A%20X%5C%3A%2010%5E%7B-3%7D%20%5C%3A%20mol%5C%3A%20l_2\" />&nbsp;untuk bereaksi sempurna. Berapa konsentrasi&nbsp;larutan&nbsp;<img alt=\"Na_2S_2O_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Na_2S_2O_3\" />&nbsp;?</p>","choices":["0,10","0,16","0,20","0,32","0.40"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NTk"},{"id":"MjU4-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi redoks berikut :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015111959.PNG\" style=\"height:25px; width:327px\" /></p><p>Setiap atom karbon akan kehilangan :</p>","choices":["1 elektron","2&nbsp;elektron","4&nbsp;elektron","6&nbsp;elektron","0&nbsp;elektron"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjA"},{"id":"MjU4-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sejumlah garam klorida lelehan dielektrolisis dengan suatu arus listrik 3.00 A jumlah deposit logam yang manakah akan memerlukan waktu elektronisis terlama ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;50 g Mg","&nbsp; 75 g Al","&nbsp; 100 g Ca","&nbsp; 125 g Fe","&nbsp; &nbsp;Jawaban A, B, C dan D semuanya benar"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjE"},{"id":"MjU4-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan Gambar sel Elektrokimia berikut ini :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015112901.PNG\" style=\"height:228px; width:230px\" /></p><p>Bila sel tersebut dioperasikan , maka elektron akan mengalir kearah :</p>","choices":["Elektroda Pb , dimana Pb akan dioksidasi.","Elektroda Cd, dimana Cd akan dioksidasi.","Elektroda Pb, dimana&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small Pb^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Pb%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;akan direduksi.","Elektroda Cd, dimana&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small Cd^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cd%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;akan direduksi.","Elektroda Pb, Dimana&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small Cd^{2+}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cd%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D\" />&nbsp;akan dioksidasi."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjI"},{"id":"MjU4-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nama IUPAC dari senyawa berikut adalah&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015113936.PNG\" style=\"height:61px; width:163px\" /></p>","choices":["2,3-dimetil-4-pentana","1,1-dimetil-2-isopropiletena","2,3-dimetil-2-pentana","2,4-dimetil-2-pentena","2,2-dimetil-5-pentena"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjM"},{"id":"MjU4-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Kedua senyawa berikut ini,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3-CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-CH_2OH\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3-O-CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-O-CH_3\" />, mempunyai massa relatif yang sama, tetapi titik didihnya tidak sama , dan titik didih masing masing adalah&nbsp;</p>","choices":["rumus molekul","panas pembakaran&nbsp;","panas spesifik","berat jenis","ikatan antar molekulnya"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjQ"},{"id":"MjU4-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pasangan isomer dari senyawa dengan rumus molekul&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small C_3H_6O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20C_3H_6O\" />&nbsp;adalah :</p>","choices":["Propanal dan propanol&nbsp;","Proopanol dan metoksi etana&nbsp;","Propanon dan propanal","Aseton dan Propanon","Asetaldehid dan aseton&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjU"},{"id":"MjU4-q23","number":23,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila senyawa isobutilena direaksikan dengan HCI , maka akan di hasilkan senyawa:</p>","choices":["1-Kloro propana","3-kloro-2-metil propena","2 kloro propena&nbsp;","ter-butil klorida","Etanal"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2NjY"},{"id":"MjU4-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bila senyawa&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small (CH_3)_2CHCHBrCH_2CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%28CH_3%29_2CHCHBrCH_2CH_3\" />&nbsp;direaksikan dengan KOH alkoholis maka produk utama yang di hasilkan adalah :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20201015114947.PNG\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2Njc"},{"id":"MjU4-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa berikut ini, manakah yang didalam air memberikan sifat bisa yang paling kuat ?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2CH_2OH\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2CHO\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2CHO\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2CO_2H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2CO_2H\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2CH_2NH_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2CH_2NH_2\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CH_3-C\\equiv CH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-C%5Cequiv%20CH\" /></p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTA2Njg"}]
